"BKNG"=>["d"=>"בוקינג הולדינגס (Booking Holdings) היא ספקית הנסיעות המקוונות הגדולה בעולם, המפעילת Booking.com, Priceline, Kayak, OpenTable ו-Agoda.","b"=>"Booking גובה commission (~13-15%) ממלונות ודירות ב-Booking.com, ומ-Priceline ב-US. Merchant model מול Agency model. Connected Trip - שאיפה לאגד כל שירות נסיעות.","p"=>"Booking.com (28M+ listings, 220+ מדינות), Priceline (US), Kayak (meta-search), Agoda (אסיה), OpenTable (מסעדות), Rentalcars.com. Genius loyalty program.","r"=>"Booking.com: ~75% Revenue. Priceline: ~15%. Kayak/OpenTable: ~10%. Take rate: ~15%. Revenue: 21 מיליארד+. EBITDA margins: 35%+.","c"=>"28M+ accommodations - largest supply globally. European dominance. Genius loyalty. Brand in 40+ languages. OpenTable covers restaurants.","g"=>"Connected Trip (air+hotel+car+experiences). AI trip planning. Attractions expansion. Asia Pacific growth. Alternative Accommodations growth.","k"=>"Recession sensitivity. Competition Airbnb (STR), Expedia. Google Hotels direct booking. OTA disintermediation risk."],
"SBUX"=>["d"=>"סטארבאקס (Starbucks Corporation) היא רשת בתי הקפה הגדולה בעולם עם 36,000+ חנויות ב-80+ מדינות, ידועה ב-Frappuccino, Starbucks Reserve ובתרבות ה-'third place'.","b"=>"Starbucks מפעילה חנויות בבעלות ופרנצ'יזות. הכנסות מ-beverage, food, merchandise ו-licensed stores. Loyalty (Rewards) מהגדולים בענף (34M+ members).","p"=>"Espresso drinks, Frappuccino, Tea (Teavana), cold brew, food, merchandise, whole bean coffee, Ready-to-Drink. Starbucks Reserve בארים. Mobile Order & Pay.","r"=>"US Company-operated: ~60%. International: ~20%. Channel Development (CPG/grocery): ~7%. Licensed stores: ~13%.","c"=>"Starbucks Rewards - 34M+ members ב-US. Mobile app loyalty. Premium brand positioning. 3rd place concept. Howard Schultz legacy.","g"=>"Middle East/Asia Pacific underpenetrated. New CEO Brian Niccol (Chipotle veteran) turnaround. Delivery. Premium Reserve bars. AI menu personalization.","k"=>"Traffic decline in US/China. Value competition (McDonald's McCafe). China slowdown (8,000+ stores). Labor costs. Brian Niccol execution risk."],
"PEP"=>["d"=>"פפסיקו (PepsiCo Inc.) היא חברת מזון ומשקאות ענק המחזיקה Pepsi, Frito-Lay, Quaker, Gatorade ו-Tropicana, עם הכנסות שנתיות של 90+ מיליארד דולר.","b"=>"PepsiCo מייצרת, שווקת ומפיצה משקאות ומזנות (snacks) ב-200+ מדינות. Snacks (Frito-Lay) מייצרים יותר משקאות (Pepsi). Diversification יתרון גדול.","p"=>"Pepsi, Mountain Dew, Gatorade, Tropicana, Lipton Tea (JV), Aquafina. Frito-Lay: Lays, Doritos, Cheetos, Tostitos. Quaker Oats. Rockstar Energy.","r"=>"Frito-Lay North America: ~25% הכנסות. Beverages North America: ~22%. International Beverages: ~20%. PBNA (snacks+beverages combined segments).","c"=>"Frito-Lay distribution network ב-US - ישיר ל-store (DSD). Brand portfolio עם 23 brands >$1B annual. Scale ב-manufacturing ו-distribution.","g"=>"Emerging markets snacks growth. Healthier options (SodaStream, PopCorners). Pricing power. International Frito-Lay. Functional beverages.","k"=>"Consumer health trends. Private label competition. Inflation/elasticity. Emerging market volatility. Regulatory on sugary beverages."],
"ASML"=>["d"=>"ASML Holding היא המובילה הגלובלית המוחלטת בייצור מכונות ליתוגרפיה EUV לייצור שבבים, עם מונופול מעשי על ה-EUV lithography machines.","b"=>"ASML מוכרת EUV ו-DUV lithography systems ל-TSMC, Samsung, Intel, Micron. כל שבב מתקדם בעולם מיוצר עם ASML equipment. Installed Base Management (IBM) = recurring.","p"=>"EUV (Extreme Ultraviolet) Lithography Systems (NXE:3600D), High-NA EUV (TWINSCAN EXE:5000), DUV (Deep UV), Metrology/Inspection, Installed Base Management services.","r"=>"Systems: ~85% הכנסות. Installed Base (services/upgrades): ~15%. Backlog: 40 מיליארד+. Revenue: 28 מיליארד שנתי. Margins: 51% gross.","c"=>"מונופול מוחלט ב-EUV: 0 מתחרים. אין TSMC/Samsung/Intel advanced chip בלי ASML. High-NA EUV = next generation (2024+). 30 שנות R&D לא ניתנות לשחזר.","g"=>"High-NA EUV adoption (TWINSCAN EXE). AI chip demand = more EUV orders. China replacement spending. Memory (DRAM EUV adoption). Installed base management growth.","k"=>"Export restrictions ל-China (DUV ו-EUV banned). Semiconductor capex cycle. Customer concentration (TSMC/Samsung/Intel = 80%+). Geopolitical risk."],
"LULU"=>["d"=>"לולולמון (Lululemon Athletica) היא מותג אתלייז'ר premium המוביל בעולם, הידוע בחותלות Align ובבגדי ספורט tech-driven ב-$100+ לפריט.","b"=>"Lululemon מוכרת DTC (direct-to-consumer) ב-retail stores ו-e-commerce. Community flywheel: yoga/fitness instructors ambassador program. Premium pricing with minimal discounting.","p"=>"Align leggings, ABC pants, Wunder Under, Scuba hoodies, Define Jacket, In Movement tights, Belt Bags, MIRROR (home fitness - discontinued). Footwear (new). Men's line expansion.","r"=>"DTC: 85%+. Wholesale: ~15%. E-commerce: ~40%. North America: ~85%. International: ~15% (growing). Revenue: 10 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Premium positioning with community-based marketing. Guest loyalty without formal program. Technical fabric innovation (Luon, Nulu). No discounting culture.","g"=>"International expansion (China, Europe). Men's category. Footwear. Power of Three x2 strategic plan. Non-yoga activities (hiking, tennis).","k"=>"Competition Nike ו-Athleta. Consumer trading down in recession. MIRROR write-off. International execution. Founder Bill Wilson controversies."],
"ZM"=>["d"=>"זום ויידיאו קומיוניקיישנס (Zoom Video Communications) היא פלטפורמת תקשורת מאוחדת (UC) המוכרת מהפנדמיה, ומנסה לבסס עצמה כפלטפורמת AI-first לעסקים.","b"=>"Zoom מוכרת מינויי Zoom Meetings, Phone (UCaaS), Rooms ו-Contact Center. AI Companion מוסיף value. Transition מ-SMB הגדל ל-Enterprise.","p"=>"Zoom Meetings, Zoom Phone (UCaaS), Zoom Rooms, Zoom Webinars, Zoom Contact Center, Zoom AI Companion (meeting summaries, transcriptions), Zoom IQ, Zoom Revenue Accelerator.","r"=>"Enterprise: ~58% ARR. Online (SMB): ~42%. Enterprise growing, Online churning. Revenue: 4.7 מיליארד. Growth slowed post-pandemic surge.","c"=>"Brand recognition - 'let's Zoom' = verb. Ease of use. 300M daily meeting participants. AI Companion for free (competitive differentiator).","g"=>"AI Companion (summaries, coaching). Contact Center (CCaaS). Zoom Phone enterprise expansion. Developer platform (Zoom Apps). Workforce management.","k"=>"Post-pandemic saturation. Microsoft Teams competition (bundled with M365). Google Meet. Webex. SMB churn. Growth normalization."],
"BIDU"=>["d"=>"בייידו (Baidu Inc.) היא מנוע החיפוש המוביל בסין, עם נוכחות גדלה ב-AI, Cloud ו-Apollo (רכב אוטונומי). ידועה כ-'Google של סין'.","b"=>"Baidu מרוויחה מפרסום בחיפוש (Search ads), ו-Baidu AI Cloud. ERNIE Bot הוא מתחרה ל-ChatGPT בסין. Apollo מייצר הכנסות מ-Robotaxi.","p"=>"Baidu Search Engine, Baidu AI Cloud (IaaS/PaaS), ERNIE Bot (LLM AI assistant), Apollo Go Robotaxi (Wuhan, Beijing), iQIYI (streaming - subsidiary), Baidu Maps.","r"=>"Online Marketing (search ads): ~65%. AI Cloud: ~27%. Other (Apollo, iQIYI): ~8%. Revenue: 34 מיליארד CNY שנתי (~5B USD).","c"=>"Search dominance בסין (65%+ market share). ERNIE training on Chinese data. Apollo מוביל ב-autonomous driving רישיונות בסין. Regulatory favoritism.","g"=>"ERNIE 4.0 AI capabilities. Apollo Robotaxi commercial expansion (Wuhan 1M+ rides). AI Cloud growth. ERNIE API monetization.","k"=>"ByteDance (Douyin/Toutiao) competition. Regulatory risk ב-China. iQIYI losses. US-China tensions (ADR delisting risk). AI compute restrictions."],
