"ON"=>["d"=>"ON Semiconductor (onsemi) היא יצרנית שבבים המתמקדת ב-Power Semiconductors ו-Sensing Solutions לרכב חשמלי ואנרגיה ירוקה, שינתה כיוון אסטרטגי ב-2021.","b"=>"onsemi מייצרת SiC (Silicon Carbide) MOSFETs ל-EV inverters ו-silicon-based IGBTs. Under CEO Hassane El-Khoury, מיקדה על automotive ו-industrial ועזבה consumer.","p"=>"SiC MOSFETs ל-EV traction inverters, IGBT modules, Intelligent Power Modules, CMOS image sensors (Hyper/Globalshutter), analog/mixed signal for automotive.","r"=>"Automotive: ~52%. Industrial: ~28%. Others: ~20%. Revenue: 7.5 מיליארד+. SiC revenue growing 50%+ YoY.","c"=>"Vertical integration ב-SiC: boule growing, wafering, device manufacturing. Long-term supply agreements (Tesla, Hyundai). Captive fab capacity advantage.","g"=>"SiC EV transition. Intelligent sensing ל-ADAS. Energy infrastructure (solar inverters). SiC supply agreements 2025-2030. EEVT EV sales volume.","k"=>"SiC competition (Wolfspeed, STMicro, Infineon). EV demand slowdown ב-2024. Inventory correction. China competition. Capital intensive SiC fabs."],
"SMCI"=>["d"=>"סופר מיקרו קומפיוטר (Super Micro Computer) היא יצרנית שרתים ומערכות אחסון מותאמות אישית, הנהנית מגל ה-AI infrastructure buildout.","b"=>"SMCI מייצרת server systems ו-rack solutions שניתנות להתאמה אישית מהירה. Time-to-market מהיר יחסית ל-Dell/HPE. NVIDIA AI GPU systems - הזדמנות עצומה.","p"=>"AI/HPC GPU servers (עם NVIDIA H100/H200/B200), Storage servers, Rackmount servers, Blade servers, SuperCloud (data center solutions), liquid cooling systems.","r"=>"Server & Components: ~94%. Storage: ~6%. Revenue: 15 מיליארד+ שנתי (קפיצה מ-2B ב-2022). AI server demand = growth engine.","c"=>"Speed to market ב-custom AI server configurations. Liquid cooling leadership. Building Block Solutions architecture. Close NVIDIA partnership.","g"=>"AI GPU server demand. Liquid cooling expansion (Direct Liquid Cooling ל-data centers). International markets. DLC data center deployments.","k"=>"Accounting irregularities (delayed 10-K filing 2024). Auditor Ernst & Young resigned. Competition Dell, HPE. Gross margin compression. NVIDIA allocation risk."],
"MSTR"=>["d"=>"מיקרוסטרטגי (MicroStrategy, כיום Strategy) היא חברת תוכנה שהפכה ל-Bitcoin treasury company, עם 200,000+ BTC בשוויי 20+ מיליארד דולר.","b"=>"Strategy רוכשת Bitcoin בכל הזדמנות, ממנת את הרכישות ב-equity offerings ו-convertible notes. Business Intelligence software עדיין פועל אך זניח. MSTR = leveraged BTC.","p"=>"MicroStrategy BI Software (ONE Platform - enterprise analytics). Bitcoin Treasury - 200,000+ BTC. Bitcoin Yield KPI. Bitcoin ATM exposure (indirect).","r"=>"Software Revenue: ~140M שנתי (ירד). Bitcoin appreciation = עיקר ה-value. MSTR leveraged BTC proxy.","c"=>"First-mover ב-corporate BTC adoption. Michael Saylor credibility. BTC yield strategy - dilutive equity issuance + BTC appreciation = positive carry.","g"=>"Bitcoin appreciation cycle. Potential BTC ETF inclusion. Nasdaq 100 inclusion (2024). More corporate BTC adoption following MSTR.","k"=>"Bitcoin price collapse. High debt (convertible notes). Margin calls. Regulatory. Execution risk. Software business not growing."],
"MPWR"=>["d"=>"מונוליתיק פאואר סיסטמס (Monolithic Power Systems) היא יצרנית שבבי power management premium ל-AI data centers, enterprise, automotive ו-consumer.","b"=>"MPWR מעצבת power management ICs בעלי יעילות גבוהה. Core market: data center VR (Voltage Regulators) ל-AI GPUs ו-CPUs. Fabless עם TSMC.","p"=>"Voltage Regulators ל-AI servers (NVIDIA GPU VR), Power Management ICs ל-data center, EV power modules, Solar microinverters, Display drivers, Industrial PMICs.","r"=>"Enterprise Data: ~36%. Automotive: ~18%. Communications: ~16%. Consumer: ~15%. Industrial: ~15%. Revenue: 2.2 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Best-in-class efficiency VR technology. Premium pricing justified by power savings. AI GPU VR design wins (NVIDIA, AMD). Diversified end markets.","g"=>"AI data center power density growth. EV power modules expansion. Industrial automation. 48V power architecture adoption. Automotive electrification.","k"=>"Inventory cycles. Competition TI, Renesas, Infineon. Customer concentration (data center). TSMC capacity. Premium pricing pressure."],
"ROKU"=>["d"=>"רוקו (Roku Inc.) היא פלטפורמת ה-CTV (Connected TV) המובילה בארה'ב עם 85M+ active accounts ו-TV sets מובנית ב-40%+ מ-smart TVs נמכרות.","b"=>"Roku מרוויחה מ-Platform Revenue (פרסום ב-CTV, Roku Channel, data licensing) ולא ממכירת devices. מודל: devices sold at/below cost לגייס users, platform monetize.","p"=>"Roku OS (built-in TVs), Roku streaming players, The Roku Channel (AVOD), Roku Ads Manager, OneView ad platform, Roku TV (Roku-branded TVs), Shopper Media.","r"=>"Platform Revenue: ~88% (CTV ads + licensing). Devices: ~12%. ARPU: $45+. Revenue: 4 מיליארד+. Streaming Hours: 30 billion+ שנתי.","c"=>"OS on 40% US smart TVs sold. 85M active accounts. First-party data from viewing behavior. OneView ad platform. Partnership with major studios.","g"=>"CTV advertising displacement of linear TV ($65B market). Roku-branded TVs. International expansion (Mexico, Canada). Shopper Media (retail data).","k"=>"Competition Fire TV (Amazon), Google TV (Chromecast), Apple TV. Macro ad spend. Content licensing costs (Roku Channel). International slower."],
"WDAY"=>["d"=>"וורקדיי (Workday Inc.) היא ספקית תוכנת HCM (Human Capital Management) וכספים ארגוניים, ידועה בפלטפורמת הענן שלה לניהול עובדים ורשימות חשבונאיות.","b"=>"Workday מוכרת מינויי SaaS ל-enterprise: Workday HCM, Financial Management, Planning. ARR high. Switching cost עצום (core HR + finance systems).","p"=>"Workday HCM (HR, Payroll, Talent), Workday Financial Management (ERP בענן), Workday Adaptive Planning, Workday Skills Cloud, Workday AI (Illuminate AI).","r"=>"Subscription Services: ~90%+. Professional Services: ~10%. ARR: 7.7 מיליארד+. Revenue growth: 17%. Backlog: 22 מיליארד+.","c"=>"HR + Finance on single platform = unique (vs SAP + Workday or Oracle + HR). Switching cost: years of data + retraining + process change. Fortune 500 penetration.","g"=>"Workday AI (Illuminate AI) embedded. Financial Management expansion (mid-market). Workday Extend (custom apps). International HCM.","k"=>"SAP S/4HANA competition. Oracle Fusion. Replacement cycles long. Economic slowdown = deferred upgrades. International slower than expected."],
"JPM"=>["d"=>"ג'פ מורגן צ'ייס (JPMorgan Chase) היא הבנק הגדול בארה'ב לפי נכסים (3.9 טריליון), מציעה שירותים בנקאיים צרכניים, investment banking ו-asset management.","b"=>"JP Morgan פועלת ב-4 קווים: Consumer & Community Banking, Commercial Banking, Corporate & Investment Bank, Asset & Wealth Management. Jamie Dimon - מנכ'ל מוביל בעולם.","p"=>"Chase banking (80M+ customers), JPMorgan investment banking (M&A, IPO, debt), Markets (trading), Asset Management ($3T AUM), Chase Sapphire (כרטיסי credit), Chase Pay.","r"=>"Net Interest Income: ~50%+ הכנסות. Noninterest Income: ~50%. ROE: 17%+. EPS קבוע גידול. Dividend $1.25/quarter.","c"=>"Global scale ב-IB וב-markets. Chase brand ו-distribution. Balance sheet strength. Jamie Dimon management. Fortress balance sheet.","g"=>"AI adoption (JPMC AI platform). Wealth management expansion. International consumer banking. Payments innovation (Chase Pay).","k"=>"Regulatory capital requirements (Basel III endgame). Rate cycle. Commercial real estate exposure. IB revenue cyclicality."],
"GS"=>["d"=>"גולדמן זאקס (Goldman Sachs) היא אחת מבנקי ההשקעות המובילים בעולם ב-M&A, underwriting, trading ו-asset management, עם 150+ שנות היסטוריה.","b"=>"Goldman פועלת ב: Global Banking & Markets (IB, trading), Asset & Wealth Management, Platform Solutions (Marcus, GreenSky). David Solomon מוביל עסקי core.","p"=>"Investment Banking (M&A, ECM, DCM), Equities Trading, FICC Trading, Asset Management ($2.8T AUM), Goldman Sachs Alternatives, Marcus (digital banking, winding down), Private Credit.","r"=>"Global Banking & Markets: ~67%. Asset & Wealth Management: ~28%. Platform Solutions: ~5%. Revenue: 47 מיליארד+ שנתי.","c"=>"Talent concentration - top graduates globally. Deal flow network. Alternatives AUM (PE, real estate, infrastructure) = growing fee stream. Balance sheet.","g"=>"IB cycle recovery (M&A, IPOs). Alternatives expansion ($300B+ target). Private credit growth. Asset management fees. AI-assisted trading.","k"=>"Marcus consumer banking retreat (wrote off billions). IB revenue cyclicality. Regulatory capital. Competition от boutique banks. CEO controversy."],
"V"=>["d"=>"ויזה (Visa Inc.) היא רשת תשלומים הגדולה בעולם, מחברת בין 14,500+ בנקים ל-4+ מיליארד כרטיסים ו-130M+ merchants ב-200+ מדינות.","b"=>"Visa אינה מספקת אשראי - היא מפעילה רשת payment network ו-גובה data processing fees מ-merchants ו-issuers. Asset-light model עם מרג'ין של 65%+.","p"=>"Visa Credit/Debit cards, Visa Direct (P2P payments), Visa B2B Connect, Visa Commercial Solutions, CyberSource (fraud/payment gateway), Verifi (dispute resolution), Tap to Pay.","r"=>"Service Revenue: ~37%. Data Processing: ~38%. International Transactions: ~22%. Other: ~3%. Payment volume: $12T שנתי.","c"=>"Network effect: 4+ billion cards + 130M+ merchants = impossible to recreate. Duopoly עם Mastercard. Decades of infrastructure. Brand trust globally.","g"=>"Cross-border payments recovery. Value-added services (issuing, consulting). New flows (B2B, P2P, G2C). Click to Pay. Crypto (USDC settlement).","k"=>"Regulation on interchange fees (EU, US). Real-time payment alternatives (FedNow, RTP). Fintech direct payment bypass. Antitrust scrutiny."],
"MA"=>["d"=>"מאסטרקארד (Mastercard Incorporated) היא רשת תשלומים גלובלית, ידועה בכרטיסי credit/debit ו-value-added services כמו Mastercard Data & Services.","b"=>"Mastercard מפעילה payment network ו-technology platform. אינה מלווה - issuers (בנקים) נושאים credit risk. יחד עם Visa = duopoly ב-global card payments.","p"=>"Mastercard credit/debit/prepaid, Mastercard World/Platinum, Priceless experiences, Mastercard Data & Services (analytics), Brighterion AI (fraud), NuData (behavioral analytics).","r"=>"Net Revenue: $25B+. Service fees, processing fees, international assessments. ROE: 190%+. Net margin: 45%+.","c"=>"Payment network duopoly. Spend volume data. Issuer relationships. Brand premium (priceless). Data & Services revenue stream higher margin.","g"=>"Services expansion (Verizon Pay, installments). Open Banking (Aiia). Crypto integration. Cross-border recovery. B2B payments. Mastercard AI.","k"=>"Regulatory interchange fees. Fintech bypass (Stripe, PayPal). BNPL. Real-time payments (FedNow). Antitrust."],
"XOM"=>["d"=>"אקסון מוביל (ExxonMobil Corporation) היא חברת הנפט והגז הגדולה בארה'ב, עם פעילות ב-exploration, production, refining ו-chemicals ב-30+ מדינות.","b"=>"ExxonMobil מרוויחה מ-Upstream (כרית נפט וגז), Downstream (זיקוק ומכירת דלק), Chemical (פטרוכימיה) ו-Carbon Capture. Dividend aristocrat - 40+ שנות גידול דיבידנד.","p"=>"Upstream E&P (Permian Basin, Guyana, LNG), Downstream refining (1.5M+ bpd capacity), Lubes & Lubricants (Mobil 1), ExxonMobil Chemical, Carbon Capture and Storage projects.","r"=>"Upstream: ~65% רווח. Downstream: ~25%. Chemical: ~10%. Revenue: 400 מיליארד+. CapEx Guyana + Permian = growth engines.","c"=>"Permian Basin dominance (1.5M bpd by 2030). Guyana deepwater (low cost barrel). Integrated model. Balance sheet strength (net cash). Pioneer acquisition synergies.","g"=>"Guyana ramp-up (low-cost barrels). Permian growth post-Pioneer acquisition. Carbon Capture. LNG expansion. Chemical biofuels.","k"=>"Oil price cycles. Energy transition/ESG. Regulatory. Carbon tax. Guyana above-ground risks. Pioneer integration."],
